<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.300"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">不经意 / 却又难以置信的事</text><text for="L2">明明微不足道 / 却偏偏不肯退让</text><text for="L3">笑不出来 笑不出来</text><text for="L4">不知不觉间 竟走到了这一步</text><text for="L5">想要改变 / 却无力改变的两人</text><text for="L6">不明白 / 也无法理解 就这样</text><text for="L7">彼此错过 又彼此纠缠</text><text for="L8">两颗恒星</text><text for="L9">各自背负着命运</text><text for="L10">我并非什么都懂</text><text for="L11">也不知你是否背负着罪与愧疚</text><text for="L12">我也没有化解这一切的答案</text><text for="L13">可我看得见</text><text for="L14">牵系我们的羁绊不会让彼此迷失</text><text for="L15">它早已融进你的血脉</text><text for="L16">告诉我 这样的羁绊又怎会断开</text><text for="L17">这样荒唐的未来</text><text for="L18">难道再无救赎</text><text for="L19">残酷的启示录</text><text for="L20">呐 为什么</text><text for="L21">这样的结局</text><text for="L22">我从未盼望过</text><text for="L23">我知道</text><text for="L24">其实我早已察觉</text><text for="L25">在夜空中相依并肩</text><text for="L26">如那星辰一般</text><text for="L27">一定 一定</text><text for="L28">其实我们两人</text><text for="L29">一直 一直</text><text for="L30">明明都心系着彼此</text><text for="L31">无论岁月流转多久</text><text for="L32">纵使彼此相隔再远</text><text for="L33">与你一同走过的那些日子 至今依然</text><text for="L34">如遥远彼方的星辰般熠熠生辉</text><text for="L35">我不会再让你看见我的泪</text><text for="L36">我要变得比谁都更坚强</text><text for="L37">总有一天 在放晴的天空下</text><text for="L38">因为我还想再与你一同欢笑</text><text for="L39">呐 你还记得吗</text><text for="L40">小时候总爱哭鼻子的</text><text for="L41">那个我 你曾紧紧</text><text for="L42">拥入怀中</text><text for="L43">呐 你还记得吗</text><text for="L44">哪怕有一天我们天各一方</text><text for="L45">你也一定会回来</text><text for="L46">你曾这样对我说</text><text for="L47">我并非什么都懂</text><text for="L48">也不知你是否背负着罪与愧疚</text><text for="L49">我也没有化解这一切的答案</text><text for="L50">可我看得见</text><text for="L51">牵系我们的羁绊不会让彼此迷失</text><text for="L52">它早已融进你的血脉</text><text for="L53">告诉我 这样的羁绊又怎会断开</text><text for="L54">可我还是想说</text><text for="L55">我们并非什么都懂</text><text for="L56">我们的想法各不相同</text><text for="L57">但总有些事永远不会改变</text><text for="L58">请把这些记住</text><text for="L59">牵系我们的羁绊不会让彼此迷失</text><text for="L60">不再孤独 我们彼此辉映</text><text for="L61">如梦一般 缀成星座</text><text for="L62">有你也有我</text><text for="L63">你一直独自背负着这一切走到如今吧</text><text for="L64">无论何时</text><text for="L65">呐 别忘了</text><text for="L66">无论你身在何方</text><text for="L67">总有人在牵挂着你</text><text for="L68">在连明日都望不见的暗夜里</text><text for="L69">即使迷失其中</text><text for="L70">你看 我一定</text><text for="L71">会找到你</text><text for="L72">你不是孤身一人</text><text for="L73">紧紧相系的那道直线</text><text for="L74">一跃冲出包围</text><text for="L75">是啊 无论多少次分离</text><text for="L76">我们仍会在这里重逢</text><text for="L77">我一直都相信</text><text for="L78">笼罩这座城市的那片云</text><text for="L79">我们一起将它击穿吧</text><text for="L80">呐 总有一天</text><text for="L81">一定 一定</text><text for="L82">再次相依并肩</text><text for="L83">如那星辰一般</text><text for="L84">无论岁月流转多久</text><text for="L85">纵使彼此相隔再远</text><text for="L86">你从来都不是孤身一人</text><text for="L87">举起指尖 你看 沿着星辰描摹</text><text for="L88">我不会再让你看见我的泪</text><text for="L89">我要变得比谁都更坚强</text><text for="L90">总有一天 待这片天空终于放晴</text><text for="L91">我们定会再次一同欢笑</text><text for="L92">我一直都这样相信</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Ayase</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:26.587"><div begin="10.671" end="20.028" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="10.671" end="13.232" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.671" end="11.159">何気</span><span begin="11.159" end="11.333">ない /</span> <span begin="11.700" end="12.077">あり得</span><span begin="12.077" end="12.439">な</span><span begin="12.439" end="12.755">い こ</span><span begin="12.755" end="13.232">と</span></p><p begin="13.232" end="15.843" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.232" end="13.760">くだら</span><span begin="13.760" end="13.992">ない /</span> <span begin="14.249" end="14.795">譲れな</span><span begin="14.795" end="15.138">い</span> <span begin="15.138" end="15.361">か</span><span begin="15.361" end="15.843">ら</span></p><p begin="15.843" end="17.770" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.843" end="16.307">笑え</span><span begin="16.307" end="16.577">ない</span> <span begin="16.740" end="17.255">笑え</span><span begin="17.255" end="17.408">な</span><span begin="17.408" end="17.770">い</span></p><p begin="17.770" end="20.028" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.770" end="18.123">いつ</span><span begin="18.123" end="18.431">の</span><span begin="18.431" end="18.994">間に</span> <span begin="18.994" end="19.353">こん</span><span begin="19.353" end="19.683">な</span><span begin="19.683" end="20.028">に</span></p></div><div begin="20.943" end="30.762" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="20.943" end="23.368" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.943" end="21.370">変わり</span><span begin="21.370" end="21.608">たい /</span> <span begin="21.869" end="22.400">変われ</span><span begin="22.400" end="22.882">ない</span> <span begin="22.882" end="23.368">二人</span></p><p begin="23.468" end="25.888" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.468" end="23.970">分から</span><span begin="23.970" end="24.127">ない /</span> <span begin="24.486" end="24.930">解ら</span><span begin="24.930" end="25.415">ない</span> <span begin="25.415" end="25.542">ま</span><span begin="25.542" end="25.888">ま</span></p><p begin="25.988" end="27.979" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.988" end="26.350">すれ</span><span begin="26.350" end="26.777">違い</span> <span begin="26.974" end="27.496">もつれ</span><span begin="27.496" end="27.635">合</span><span begin="27.635" end="27.979">う</span></p><p begin="27.979" end="29.344" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.979" end="28.516">二</span><span begin="28.516" end="28.670">つの</span><span begin="28.670" end="29.344">恒星</span></p><p begin="29.344" end="30.762" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.344" end="29.556">背</span><span begin="29.556" end="30.021">負った</span><span begin="30.021" end="30.762">運命</span></p></div><div begin="31.301" end="40.360" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="31.301" end="32.562" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.301" end="31.603">I don't</span> <span begin="31.603" end="31.980">know 'bout</span> <span begin="31.980" end="32.562">everything</span></p><p begin="32.562" end="33.802" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.562" end="32.855">If you</span> <span begin="32.855" end="33.215">carry</span> <span begin="33.215" end="33.530">guilt or</span> <span begin="33.530" end="33.802">sin</span></p><p begin="33.802" end="35.185" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.802" end="34.551">Resolutions</span> <span begin="34.551" end="34.789">aren't in</span> <span begin="34.789" end="35.185">me</span></p><p begin="35.257" end="36.136" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.257" end="35.490">But</span> <span begin="35.490" end="35.755">I can</span> <span begin="35.755" end="36.136">see</span></p><p begin="36.375" end="37.678" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.375" end="36.688">Ties that</span> <span begin="36.688" end="37.086">bind us</span> <span begin="37.086" end="37.267">won't</span> <span begin="37.267" end="37.678">astray</span></p><p begin="37.678" end="38.935" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.678" end="37.986">Knowin'</span> <span begin="37.986" end="38.166">deep</span> <span begin="38.166" end="38.602">inside your</span> <span begin="38.602" end="38.935">veins</span></p><p begin="38.977" end="40.360" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.977" end="39.238">Tell me</span> <span begin="39.238" end="39.534">how'd it</span> <span begin="39.534" end="39.746">break</span> <span begin="39.746" end="40.360">away?</span></p></div><div begin="40.415" end="1:03.499" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="40.415" end="42.118" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.415" end="41.146">こんな馬鹿</span><span begin="41.146" end="41.642">らしい</span><span begin="41.642" end="42.118">未来</span></p><p begin="42.118" end="43.606" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.118" end="42.647">救い</span><span begin="42.647" end="42.937">は</span><span begin="42.937" end="43.415">ない</span><span begin="43.415" end="43.606">の？</span></p><p begin="43.606" end="45.133" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.606" end="43.887">残</span><span begin="43.887" end="44.406">酷な</span><span begin="44.406" end="44.850">黙示</span><span begin="44.850" end="45.133">録</span></p><p begin="45.133" end="46.087" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.133" end="45.469">ねえ</span> <span begin="45.469" end="45.880">どうし</span><span begin="45.880" end="46.087">て</span></p><p begin="46.087" end="48.444" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.087" end="46.304">こ</span><span begin="46.304" end="46.928">んな</span><span begin="46.928" end="47.584">結</span><span begin="47.584" end="48.107">末</span><span begin="48.107" end="48.444">を</span></p><p begin="48.444" end="50.538" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.444" end="49.124">望</span><span begin="49.124" end="49.769">んでなんか</span><span begin="49.769" end="50.257">いない</span><span begin="50.257" end="50.538">よ</span></p><p begin="50.538" end="51.258" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.538" end="50.869">知っ</span><span begin="50.869" end="51.258">てる</span></p><p begin="51.258" end="52.865" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.258" end="51.851">私</span> <span begin="51.851" end="52.469">気付いて</span><span begin="52.469" end="52.865">た</span></p><p begin="52.865" end="54.892" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.865" end="53.205">夜</span><span begin="53.205" end="53.623">空</span><span begin="53.623" end="53.840">に</span><span begin="53.840" end="54.429">寄り添い</span><span begin="54.429" end="54.892">並ぶ</span></p><p begin="54.892" end="56.491" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.892" end="55.177">あの</span><span begin="55.397" end="55.774">星</span><span begin="55.774" end="56.082">の</span><span begin="56.082" end="56.366">よう</span><span begin="56.366" end="56.491">に</span></p><p begin="56.491" end="57.947" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.491" end="56.731">きっ</span><span begin="56.731" end="56.903">と</span><span begin="57.290" end="57.577">きっ</span><span begin="57.577" end="57.947">と</span></p><p begin="57.947" end="59.034" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.947" end="58.240">本</span><span begin="58.240" end="58.583">当は</span><span begin="58.583" end="59.034">二人</span></p><p begin="59.034" end="1:00.260" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.034" end="59.335">ずっ</span><span begin="59.335" end="59.507">と</span><span begin="59.816" end="1:00.126">ずっ</span><span begin="1:00.126" end="1:00.260">と</span></p><p begin="1:00.260" end="1:03.499" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.260" end="1:00.730">想</span><span begin="1:00.730" end="1:00.890">い</span><span begin="1:00.890" end="1:01.321">合ってい</span><span begin="1:01.321" end="1:01.651">たの</span><span begin="1:01.651" end="1:03.499">に</span></p></div><div begin="1:01.796" end="1:11.346" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:01.796" end="1:03.672" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.796" end="1:02.429">どれだけ</span><span begin="1:02.429" end="1:02.876">時が</span><span begin="1:02.876" end="1:03.361">過ぎて</span><span begin="1:03.361" end="1:03.672">も</span></p><p begin="1:03.672" end="1:06.233" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.672" end="1:04.270">たとえ</span> <span begin="1:04.344" end="1:04.947">どれだけ</span><span begin="1:04.947" end="1:05.864">離れていて</span><span begin="1:05.864" end="1:06.233">も</span></p><p begin="1:06.233" end="1:08.755" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.233" end="1:06.732">君と</span><span begin="1:06.883" end="1:07.310">生きたあ</span><span begin="1:07.310" end="1:08.006">の日々は</span><span begin="1:08.006" end="1:08.497">今で</span><span begin="1:08.497" end="1:08.755">も</span></p><p begin="1:08.755" end="1:11.346" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.755" end="1:09.071">遥</span><span begin="1:09.071" end="1:09.260">か</span><span begin="1:09.347" end="1:09.904">先の</span><span begin="1:09.904" end="1:10.563">星のように</span><span begin="1:10.563" end="1:11.059">キラキ</span><span begin="1:11.059" end="1:11.346">ラ</span></p></div><div begin="1:11.346" end="1:21.931" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:11.346" end="1:13.865" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.346" end="1:11.918">私</span> <span begin="1:12.028" end="1:12.752">もう涙</span><span begin="1:12.752" end="1:13.518">見せないか</span><span begin="1:13.518" end="1:13.865">ら</span></p><p begin="1:13.886" end="1:16.390" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.886" end="1:14.417">私</span> <span begin="1:14.537" end="1:15.175">誰より</span><span begin="1:15.175" end="1:15.660">強く</span><span begin="1:15.660" end="1:16.148">なるか</span><span begin="1:16.148" end="1:16.390">ら</span></p><p begin="1:16.390" end="1:18.932" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.390" end="1:17.043">いつか</span> <span begin="1:17.122" end="1:17.509">晴れた</span><span begin="1:17.509" end="1:18.486">空の下で</span> <span begin="1:18.486" end="1:18.932">ほら</span></p><p begin="1:18.932" end="1:21.931" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.932" end="1:19.341">また</span><span begin="1:19.341" end="1:19.950">一緒に</span><span begin="1:19.950" end="1:20.458">笑い</span><span begin="1:20.458" end="1:20.806">合い</span><span begin="1:20.806" end="1:21.085">たい</span><span begin="1:21.224" end="1:21.396">か</span><span begin="1:21.396" end="1:21.931">ら</span></p></div><div begin="1:22.011" end="1:31.996" itunes:songPart="Bridge"><p begin="1:22.011" end="1:24.264" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.011" end="1:22.220">ねえ</span><span begin="1:22.573" end="1:22.858">君</span><span begin="1:23.099